  "description": "Deep erg is Arrakis stripped to its harshest fantasy. It is where the desert looks endless, where navigation becomes commitment, and where mistakes are punished by distance as much as by heat.\n\nAs a biome, it is meant to feel hostile even before a strike occurs. Sparse life, weak settlement logic, and open exposure make it a place to cross, exploit, fear, or survive on the margin rather than comfortably inhabit.",
